# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
node_modules/
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions
*.log
# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/
/dist/


# production
/build
.next-cooliebase
# legacy Next.js cache from before the ruoyi→cooliebase rename; safe to delete
.next-ruoyi
# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
/data/*.db
/data/*.db-wal
/data/*.db-shm

# mobile / desktop client binaries & packages (严禁入库)
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa
*.app
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.exe
*.msi
.expo/

# compressed archives & Java packages (严禁入库)
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# heavy media files (严禁入库，建议上传对象存储/CDN)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.iso


# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
tmp/**
# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ============================================
# Flutter / Dart（apps/* 与 packages/*）
# ============================================

# Pub / 锁文件（应用提交，库不提交）
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.packages
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/build/
**/pubspec.lock
!apps/**/pubspec.lock

# Flutter 构建产物
**/.fvm/
**/coverage/
**/doc/api/
**/.history/
**/*.iml
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
**/ios/Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Runner.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/ios/Runner.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
**/ios/Runner.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/macos/Pods/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/

# Android 构建产物 / 本地配置
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/local.properties
**/android/**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
**/android/key.properties
**/android/app/release/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/.cxx/

# 签名密钥（严禁入库）
**/keystore/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.p8
gen/**
# IDE
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/launch.json

# Melos
**/.melos_tool/
melos_*.log

# Flutter test / 覆盖率
**/test/.test_coverage.dart
**/coverage/lcov.info

# 平台首个管理员初始化凭证（seed-prod 输出，含明文密码，严禁入库）
.platform-admin-credentials.txt
**/.platform-admin-credentials.txt

# 本地文件存储（infra LOCAL adapter）
.data/

# 实例级插件目录（§6.2 Plugin 的安装位置，与 §6.1 Platform Module 的源码内声明面不同）
# 默认 COOLIEBASE_PLUGIN_DIR 落在此处；插件包是运行时装进来的，不入库
.cooliebase/
# 用户上传 & TTS 临时语音文件（运行时生成，禁止入库）
public/uploads/
public/sounds/
public/dvr/

# Last npm run check stamp (local replay; not a second domain list)
docs/architecture/artifacts/harness-trace-latest.json

# 数据库自动备份（必须排除在 git 之外）
backups/
*.dump
backup_*.sql
db_backup_*.sql

^cooliebase/**
apps/cooliebase-all-base/
apps/cooliebase

# 派生证据快照: 每次跑 check 都会变，作为缓存而非源
/docs/architecture/artifacts/evolution-backlog.json

# 环境指纹: 每次构建都会变，作为流水线产物而非源
/docs/architecture/artifacts/env-fingerprint.json

# 运行期证据快照: 每次跑扫描/压测都会变，作为流水线产物而非源
/docs/architecture/artifacts/security-scan-result.json
/docs/architecture/artifacts/load-test-result.json

# 忽略 Axure 导出原型包中庞大的静态库资源，防止 Git 膨胀
.kiro/specs/**/prototypes/axure/resources/
docs/features/**/prototypes/axure/resources/
docs/specs/**/prototypes/axure/resources/

